  "bodyHash": "060149019ecac260",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>&nbsp;</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1390312/description_a30fe0b8-ed62-4ca3-9e3c-46c20d74e1a1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"814\" height=\"255\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1390312/description_e9839a64-72d4-4c3b-8539-bb4e964f3990.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"488\" height=\"283\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1390312/description_accfe2f4-375d-4cc5-a56c-355e3c074c7c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"217\" height=\"217\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\">擁有此物品時，您將獲得無限飽食度效果。</h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1390312/description_5036e0ef-8418-4e19-8705-f0cebdfeb0a1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"205\" height=\"205\">。</h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\">擁有此物品時，您將獲得無限夜視效果。</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1390312/description_7b270a82-4534-4286-9c14-7a23b1a8a2a8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"205\" height=\"205\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\">左鍵點擊傳送到您注視的位置。右鍵點擊傳送所有生物。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1390312/description_35c2dde3-05a6-477c-b8ff-bbbf326ae560.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"205\" height=\"205\"></p>\n<p>左鍵點擊指定物件，然後持續點擊右鍵以移動該物件。在物件上按住 Shift 並左鍵點擊以重置指定。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1390312/description_6376add2-27c0-419e-bcd9-180b77f7ff03.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"208\" height=\"142\"></p>\n<p>擁有此物品時，按下 B 切換遊戲模式。按下 A 重置生物。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://youtube.com/@abyuasmc?si=ppjySuqvHeM-JsWE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1390312/description_a3542575-cb79-4c04-a64d-f660aa77bcb8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"157\"></a></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:777px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/TrrNM-fesxY?si=I2GFZm017cIftIWL\" width=\"777\" height=\"457\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
